  (title_block (title "SnowOwl v2 - Shield") (company "YurilLAB")
    (comment 1 "ESP32-SnowOwl v2 - compact 2-board stack"))
  (lib_symbols)
  (text "ESP32-SnowOwl v2  --  SHIELD (expansion)
Organising principle: J1 (SOUTH) is the trunk; a central SPI SPINE runs
north from it and every SPI radio TAPS OFF it (no point-to-point runs).
All antennas live on edges with their front-ends immediately inboard.
I2C branches WEST to PN532; UART branches EAST to C5/RV1106/GPS.
Big modules (nRF24 x3, RV1106) go on the BACK to shrink the outline." (at 20 15 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6f6b354f-c362-4375-9917-ba8c4c5611d0))
